    PHONG FRUIT COLLECTOR v1.5
    Standalone fruit collector + server hop for Blox Fruits.
    Derived from v1.4 — fixes:
      • Removed undefined FireButton() call; team selection now uses
        a FireRemoteEvent path that works on most executors.
      • Moved FURINA image + setupStorage() so they are defined before use.
      • Fixed CommF_ remote path to check both legacy and current locations.
      • LinearVelocity is always cleaned up on character respawn.
      • storingInstances cleared on all failure paths.
      • Small nil-safety guards throughout.

    Requirements: executor with loadstring-compatible Lua, getgenv(),
    and optionally readfile/writefile/isfile/isfolder/makefolder for
    persistent counter storage.
]]

